From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Subject: [PATCH] winemac.drv: OpenGL through glmt (OpenGL 1.x on Metal) for
 Quake Live.

A program that is glmt's (quakelive_steam.exe by default, WINE_GLMT_EXE and WINE_GLMT otherwise)
gets every OpenGL entry point from libglmt.dylib, loaded from next to winemac.so (WINE_GLMT_LIB).
glmt renders into the CAMetalLayer of the client surface's Metal view. If it does not start, the
program has no OpenGL: there is no fallback to Mesa's EGL or to Apple's OpenGL.

Written against Mach9 0.4.0's Wine (501796b0ed1).
---
